{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"body":"AC3 UPDATE — operator action COMPLETE (supersedes the 'pending' framing in the previous AC3 comment).\n\nThe operator reports the `ANTHROPIC_API_KEY` repository secret has been rotated/added in both places: locally, and as a GitHub Actions secret on this repository. (`JIRA_API_TOKEN` was rotated earlier, separately.) No secret values were handled or recorded by the agent; this note records the fact of the action only.\n\nSo the anthropic arm's credential preflight — which failed run 31587452003 with `::error title=anthropic arm has no credential::` — now has the secret it requires. AC3 is therefore satisfied on both halves: the gap was recorded as an operator action, that action is done, and the arm's fail-not-skip design is unchanged by Gerrit 1658 (the change touches only the region env, plus a doc note and a regression test)."},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1786560017134064001,"uuid":"ec315c71-8fe8-4778-871c-80ebfd2fd1e1"}